<!doctype html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
<meta name="description" content="Campanha escolar de conscientização ambiental sobre plásticos nos oceanos. Conhecer para transformar.">
<title>Plástico: o impacto que não desaparece</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap">
<style>
/* Layout: fundo do oceano em faixas, da superfície (cabeçalho e hero) até o fundo (rodapé); texto em coluna estreita, ilustração e cartões em largura total. */
:root {
  --navy: #071E2B;
  --petrol: #0B2D3C;
  --green-dark: #145B4D;
  --mint: #74DFB6;
  --foam: #F1FAF8;
  --mist: #B3CBD0;
  --header-bg: #061925;
  --footer-bg: #041620;
  --line: rgba(179, 203, 208, 0.18);
  --radius: 18px;
  --font: "Inter", system-ui, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
  color-scheme: dark;
}

* { box-sizing: border-box; }
html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
body {
  margin: 0;
  background: var(--navy);
  color: var(--foam);
  font-family: var(--font);
  font-size: 16px;
  line-height: 1.65;
  -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
}
body::before {
  content: "";
  position: fixed;
  inset: 0 0 auto;
  height: env(safe-area-inset-top, 0px);
  background: var(--header-bg);
  z-index: 10;
}
a { color: inherit; }
:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--mint); outline-offset: 3px; border-radius: 6px; }

.wrap {
  width: 100%;
  max-width: 1120px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding-left: max(16px, env(safe-area-inset-left, 0px));
  padding-right: max(16px, env(safe-area-inset-right, 0px));
}

/* Cabeçalho */
.site-header {
  position: sticky;
  top: env(safe-area-inset-top, 0px);
  z-index: 20;
  background: var(--header-bg);
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
}
.site-header .wrap {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 8px 20px;
  padding-block: 14px;
}
.brand {
  min-width: 0;
  font-size: 12px;
  font-weight: 800;
  letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  line-height: 1.35;
}
.header-link {
  flex: none;
  font-size: 13px;
  font-weight: 600;
  color: var(--mint);
  text-decoration: none;
}
.header-link:hover { text-decoration: underline; }

/* Hero */
.hero {
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
  background:
    radial-gradient(60% 75% at 88% 30%, rgba(20, 91, 77, 0.6), transparent 70%),
    linear-gradient(180deg, var(--header-bg) 0%, var(--navy) 100%);
  padding-block: clamp(72px, 13vw, 168px) clamp(120px, 16vw, 200px);
}
.hero-waves {
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  pointer-events: none;
}
.hero-waves path { fill: none; stroke: var(--mint); stroke-width: 1.5; opacity: 0.1; }
.hero .wrap { position: relative; z-index: 1; }
.eyebrow-hero {
  margin: 0 0 22px;
  font-size: 12px;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: 0.2em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--mint);
}
h1 {
  margin: 0;
  max-width: 13em;
  font-size: clamp(42px, 9vw, 86px);
  font-weight: 800;
  line-height: 1.03;
  letter-spacing: -0.035em;
  text-wrap: balance;
  color: var(--foam);
}
h1 .accent { color: var(--mint); }
.hero-text {
  margin: 28px 0 0;
  max-width: 34em;
  font-size: clamp(19px, 2.4vw, 21px);
  color: var(--mist);
}
.btn {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 10px;
  margin-top: 36px;
  padding: 16px 30px;
  border-radius: 999px;
  background: var(--mint);
  color: var(--navy);
  font-size: 16px;
  font-weight: 700;
  text-decoration: none;
  transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;
}
.btn:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(116, 223, 182, 0.25); }
.wave-divider {
  position: absolute;
  left: 0;
  right: 0;
  bottom: -1px;
  width: 100%;
  height: clamp(48px, 7vw, 96px);
  display: block;
}
.wave-divider path { fill: var(--petrol); }

/* Seções */
.section { padding-block: clamp(64px, 9vw, 120px); }
.section-problem { background: var(--petrol); }
.section-scale { background: var(--navy); }
.section-refs { background: var(--petrol); }

.label {
  margin: 0 0 14px;
  font-size: 13px;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: 0.16em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--mint);
}
h2 {
  margin: 0;
  max-width: 16em;
  font-size: clamp(30px, 5vw, 48px);
  font-weight: 800;
  line-height: 1.1;
  letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  text-wrap: balance;
}
.lead {
  margin: 24px 0 0;
  max-width: 38em;
  font-size: clamp(19px, 2.2vw, 21px);
  color: var(--foam);
}
.body-text {
  margin: 18px 0 0;
  max-width: 40em;
  font-size: 16px;
  color: var(--mist);
}

figure { margin: clamp(36px, 6vw, 64px) 0 0; }
.scene {
  display: block;
  width: 100%;
  height: auto;
  border-radius: var(--radius);
  border: 1px solid var(--line);
}
figcaption { margin-top: 12px; font-size: 13px; color: var(--mist); }

/* Dimensão */
.compare {
  margin-top: clamp(36px, 6vw, 56px);
  padding: clamp(28px, 5vw, 64px) clamp(20px, 4vw, 56px);
  border-radius: var(--radius);
  border: 1px solid var(--line);
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--green-dark) 0%, var(--petrol) 55%, var(--navy) 100%);
  text-align: center;
}
.compare-label {
  margin: 0;
  font-size: 13px;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: 0.14em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--mist);
}
.compare-number {
  margin: 14px 0 0;
  font-size: clamp(72px, 19vw, 176px);
  font-weight: 800;
  line-height: 0.95;
  letter-spacing: -0.045em;
  color: var(--mint);
  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
}
.compare-unit {
  margin: 8px 0 0;
  font-size: clamp(28px, 5vw, 44px);
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: -0.02em;
}
.compare-text {
  margin: 24px auto 0;
  max-width: 36em;
  font-size: clamp(17px, 2vw, 19px);
  color: var(--foam);
}
.compare-note {
  margin: 32px auto 0;
  padding-top: 20px;
  max-width: 46em;
  border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  font-size: 13px;
  line-height: 1.6;
  color: var(--mist);
}

.facts {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  gap: 16px;
  margin-top: 20px;
}
.fact {
  min-width: 0;
  padding: 28px 26px;
  border-radius: var(--radius);
  border: 1px solid var(--line);
  background: rgba(11, 45, 60, 0.7);
}
.fact-num {
  margin: 0;
  font-size: clamp(36px, 5vw, 46px);
  font-weight: 800;
  line-height: 1.1;
  letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  color: var(--mint);
  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
}
.fact-text { margin: 10px 0 0; font-size: 15px; color: var(--mist); }

/* Fontes */
.refs { margin: 32px 0 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; display: grid; gap: 14px; max-width: 46em; }
.refs li {
  padding: 18px 20px;
  border-radius: var(--radius);
  border: 1px solid var(--line);
  background: rgba(7, 30, 43, 0.55);
  font-size: 15px;
  color: var(--mist);
  overflow-wrap: anywhere;
}
.refs a { color: var(--mint); }

/* Rodapé */
.site-footer {
  background: var(--footer-bg);
  border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  padding-block: 48px 56px;
}
.footer-tag { margin: 0; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: var(--mint); }
.footer-title { margin: 6px 0 0; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.05em; text-transform: uppercase; }
.footer-meta { margin: 20px 0 0; max-width: 44em; font-size: 14px; color: var(--mist); }

/* Ilustração: movimento discreto */
.bubble { animation: rise 9s ease-in infinite; }
.b2 { animation-duration: 12s; animation-delay: -4s; }
.b3 { animation-duration: 10s; animation-delay: -7s; }
.b4 { animation-duration: 14s; animation-delay: -2s; }
.turtle { animation: bob 6s ease-in-out infinite; }
@keyframes rise { 0% { transform: translateY(0); opacity: 0.5; } 100% { transform: translateY(-120px); opacity: 0; } }
@keyframes bob { 0%, 100% { transform: translate(480px, 190px); } 50% { transform: translate(480px, 180px); } }

@media (min-width: 720px) {
  .facts { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); }
}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  html { scroll-behavior: auto; }
  .bubble, .turtle { animation: none; }
  .turtle { transform: translate(480px, 190px); }
  .btn { transition: none; }
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header class="site-header">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="brand">Plástico: o impacto que não desaparece</div>
    <a class="header-link" href="#fontes">Fontes científicas ↓</a>
  </div>
</header>

<main>
  <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="titulo">
    <svg class="hero-waves" viewBox="0 0 1440 600" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true">
      <path d="M0,360 C240,320 480,400 720,360 S1200,320 1440,370"/>
      <path d="M0,420 C260,380 500,460 740,420 S1200,380 1440,430"/>
      <path d="M0,480 C220,450 520,520 760,480 S1220,450 1440,490"/>
    </svg>
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow-hero">Campanha de conscientização ambiental · 3º ano</p>
      <h1 id="titulo">O plástico que você descarta <span class="accent">não desaparece.</span></h1>
      <p class="hero-text">O oceano pode estar longe de nós. Mas as consequências do descarte incorreto chegam muito mais longe do que imaginamos.</p>
      <a class="btn" href="#problema">Entenda o problema ↓</a>
    </div>
    <svg class="wave-divider" viewBox="0 0 1440 80" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true">
      <path d="M0,40 C240,80 480,0 720,36 C960,72 1200,8 1440,44 L1440,80 L0,80 Z"/>
    </svg>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-problem" id="problema" aria-labelledby="t-problema">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="label">01 / O problema</p>
      <h2 id="t-problema">Da nossa rua até o oceano.</h2>
      <p class="lead">Uma embalagem abandonada na rua pode ser levada pela chuva para bueiros, córregos e rios. Parte desses resíduos chega ao mar, onde ameaça animais e ecossistemas.</p>
      <p class="body-text">Nem todo lixo jogado no chão chega ao oceano, mas o descarte inadequado aumenta esse risco. Reduzir a poluição começa muito antes da praia.</p>

      <figure>
        <svg class="scene" viewBox="0 0 960 380" role="img" aria-label="Ilustração de uma tartaruga marinha nadando em águas azul-escuras, cercada por garrafas e sacolas plásticas.">
          <defs>
            <linearGradient id="mar" x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="1">
              <stop offset="0" stop-color="#0E3A52"/>
              <stop offset="0.55" stop-color="#0B2D3C"/>
              <stop offset="1" stop-color="#041620"/>
            </linearGradient>
            <radialGradient id="luz" cx="0.5" cy="0.45" r="0.5">
              <stop offset="0" stop-color="#74DFB6" stop-opacity="0.16"/>
              <stop offset="1" stop-color="#74DFB6" stop-opacity="0"/>
            </radialGradient>
            <linearGradient id="casco" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="1">
              <stop offset="0" stop-color="#1B7A64"/>
              <stop offset="1" stop-color="#0F4A3F"/>
            </linearGradient>
          </defs>
          <rect width="960" height="380" fill="url(#mar)"/>
          <rect width="960" height="380" fill="url(#luz)"/>

          <!-- bolhas -->
          <g fill="none" stroke="#B3CBD0" stroke-width="1.5" opacity="0.5">
            <circle class="bubble" cx="120" cy="320" r="7"/>
            <circle class="bubble b2" cx="170" cy="340" r="4"/>
            <circle class="bubble b3" cx="610" cy="350" r="6"/>
            <circle class="bubble b4" cx="860" cy="330" r="8"/>
            <circle class="bubble b2" cx="880" cy="350" r="4"/>
            <circle class="bubble b3" cx="360" cy="360" r="5"/>
          </g>

          <!-- sacolas -->
          <g fill="rgba(241,250,248,0.16)" stroke="rgba(241,250,248,0.5)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <g transform="translate(205 232) rotate(-12)">
              <path d="M0,0 C20,-18 52,-18 66,2 C78,20 70,48 40,56 C16,62 -6,46 -10,26 C-12,14 -8,6 0,0 Z"/>
              <path fill="none" d="M14,-6 C16,-26 30,-30 34,-10 M44,-8 C48,-28 62,-26 60,-4"/>
            </g>
            <g transform="translate(770 112) rotate(18) scale(0.85)">
              <path d="M0,0 C20,-18 52,-18 66,2 C78,20 70,48 40,56 C16,62 -6,46 -10,26 C-12,14 -8,6 0,0 Z"/>
              <path fill="none" d="M14,-6 C16,-26 30,-30 34,-10 M44,-8 C48,-28 62,-26 60,-4"/>
            </g>
            <g transform="translate(60 300) rotate(8) scale(0.7)">
              <path d="M0,0 C20,-18 52,-18 66,2 C78,20 70,48 40,56 C16,62 -6,46 -10,26 C-12,14 -8,6 0,0 Z"/>
              <path fill="none" d="M14,-6 C16,-26 30,-30 34,-10 M44,-8 C48,-28 62,-26 60,-4"/>
            </g>
          </g>

          <!-- garrafas -->
          <g fill="rgba(179,203,208,0.26)" stroke="rgba(179,203,208,0.75)" stroke-width="1.5">
            <g transform="translate(150 105) rotate(-35)">
              <rect x="-14" y="-10" width="28" height="64" rx="9"/>
              <rect x="-7" y="-26" width="14" height="18" rx="3"/>
              <rect x="-8" y="-32" width="16" height="8" rx="2" fill="#B3CBD0" stroke="none"/>
              <path d="M-6,0 V40" fill="none" stroke="#F1FAF8" stroke-opacity="0.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
            </g>
            <g transform="translate(800 275) rotate(28)">
              <rect x="-14" y="-10" width="28" height="64" rx="9"/>
              <rect x="-7" y="-26" width="14" height="18" rx="3"/>
              <rect x="-8" y="-32" width="16" height="8" rx="2" fill="#B3CBD0" stroke="none"/>
              <path d="M-6,0 V40" fill="none" stroke="#F1FAF8" stroke-opacity="0.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
            </g>
            <g transform="translate(300 300) rotate(70) scale(0.9)">
              <rect x="-14" y="-10" width="28" height="64" rx="9"/>
              <rect x="-7" y="-26" width="14" height="18" rx="3"/>
              <rect x="-8" y="-32" width="16" height="8" rx="2" fill="#B3CBD0" stroke="none"/>
            </g>
            <g transform="translate(690 60) rotate(-62) scale(0.85)">
              <rect x="-14" y="-10" width="28" height="64" rx="9"/>
              <rect x="-7" y="-26" width="14" height="18" rx="3"/>
              <rect x="-8" y="-32" width="16" height="8" rx="2" fill="#B3CBD0" stroke="none"/>
            </g>
          </g>

          <!-- tartaruga (vista de cima, cabeça à direita) -->
          <g class="turtle" transform="translate(480 190)">
            <g fill="#1A7A64" stroke="rgba(116,223,182,0.4)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M70,-52 C100,-95 150,-118 188,-104 C168,-80 128,-58 94,-40 Z"/>
              <path d="M70,52 C100,95 150,118 188,104 C168,80 128,58 94,40 Z"/>
              <path d="M-82,-48 C-104,-78 -134,-88 -152,-78 C-142,-52 -116,-38 -90,-34 Z"/>
              <path d="M-82,48 C-104,78 -134,88 -152,78 C-142,52 -116,38 -90,34 Z"/>
              <path d="M-110,-6 L-152,0 L-110,6 Z"/>
              <ellipse cx="140" cy="0" rx="36" ry="27"/>
            </g>
            <ellipse rx="112" ry="74" fill="url(#casco)" stroke="rgba(116,223,182,0.55)" stroke-width="2"/>
            <g fill="none" stroke="rgba(116,223,182,0.45)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round">
              <polygon points="-34,0 -17,-30 17,-30 34,0 17,30 -17,30"/>
              <path d="M-34,0 L-104,0 M34,0 L104,0 M-17,-30 L-58,-58 M17,-30 L58,-58 M-17,30 L-58,58 M17,30 L58,58"/>
            </g>
            <circle cx="153" cy="-10" r="4.5" fill="#F1FAF8"/>
            <circle cx="154" cy="-10" r="2" fill="#041620"/>
            <circle cx="153" cy="10" r="4.5" fill="#F1FAF8"/>
            <circle cx="154" cy="10" r="2" fill="#041620"/>
          </g>
        </svg>
        <figcaption>Ilustração: tartaruga marinha entre garrafas e sacolas plásticas.</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-scale" aria-labelledby="t-dimensao">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="label">02 / A dimensão</p>
      <h2 id="t-dimensao">Uma quantidade difícil de imaginar.</h2>
      <p class="lead">Segundo a OCDE, aproximadamente 1,7 milhão de toneladas de resíduos plásticos chegaram aos oceanos em 2019.</p>

      <div class="compare">
        <p class="compare-label">Equivalência aproximada de massa</p>
        <p class="compare-number">850 mil</p>
        <p class="compare-unit">SUVs</p>
        <p class="compare-text">Se cada SUV pesar, hipoteticamente, 2 toneladas, seriam necessários 850.000 veículos para igualar a massa estimada de plástico que chegou aos oceanos naquele ano.</p>
        <p class="compare-note">Cálculo: 1.700.000 toneladas ÷ 2 toneladas por SUV = 850.000 SUVs. Comparação apenas de massa, não de volume. Dado referente a 2019, não a cada dia.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="facts">
        <div class="fact">
          <p class="fact-num">2019</p>
          <p class="fact-text">Ano de referência do dado apresentado pela OCDE.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="fact">
          <p class="fact-num">1,7 milhão</p>
          <p class="fact-text">de toneladas de resíduos plásticos chegaram aos oceanos em 2019, segundo a OCDE.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="fact">
          <p class="fact-num">2 t</p>
          <p class="fact-text">Massa hipotética considerada para cada SUV no cálculo da comparação.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-refs" id="fontes" aria-labelledby="t-fontes">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="label">Referências</p>
      <h2 id="t-fontes">Fontes científicas</h2>
      <ol class="refs">
        <li>OCDE (OECD). <em>Global Plastics Outlook</em>. Paris: OECD Publishing. Dado de 2019 sobre resíduos plásticos que chegaram aos oceanos. <a href="https://www.oecd.org/environment/plastics/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">oecd.org/environment/plastics</a></li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>

<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="footer-tag">Conhecer para transformar.</p>
    <p class="footer-title">Plástico: o impacto que não desaparece</p>
    <p class="footer-meta">Projeto de Química do 3º ano do Ensino Médio · Escola Estadual de Ensino Médio José de Anchieta · Estudantes: Cainã, Bruna, Gabrielly e Jordana.</p>
  </div>
</footer>
</body>
</html>
